        <!-- HERO BANNER END--> 
      <section class="relative inside-banner-outer overflow-hidden">
         <div class="inside-banner-inner banner-animation relative ">

            <!-- Banner -->
            <div class="rounded-bottom-lr overflow-hidden h-170 rounded-bl-xl rounded-br-xl relative innerbanner-image-wrapper">

               <!-- Parallax Image -->
               <picture>
                  <!-- Desktop -->
                  <source media="(min-width:1024px)"
                     srcset="assets/images/banners/company-info-banner-desktop.webp">

                  <!-- Tablet -->
                  <source media="(min-width:768px)"
                     srcset="assets/images/banners/company-info-banner-mob.webp">

                  <!-- Mobile -->
                  <img
                     src="assets/images/banners/company-info-banner-mob.webp"
                     alt="About Bubble Food"
                     class="innerbanner-image absolute left-0 top-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
                     loading="eager"
                     fetchpriority="high">
               </picture>

               <!-- Keep Existing Overlay -->
               <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/60 via-black/40 to-black/70 z-10"></div>


            </div>

            <!-- Content -->
           
               <div class="innerbanner-caption absolute inset-0 z-30 flex items-end">
                  <div class="container pb-12 md:pb-15">
                     <div class="max-w-4xl text-left">

                        <nav class="mb-4" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                           <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
                              <li>
                                 <a href="/" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition">
                                    Home
                                 </a>
                              </li>

                              <li class="text-white/60">/</li>

                              <li class="text-white">
                                 About Us
                              </li>
                           </ol>
                        </nav>

                        <h1 class="innerbanner-title text-h1 text-white">
                         
                           <span class="innerbanner-title-span">
                              Culinary Excellence
                           </span>
                        </h1>

                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
           

         </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ====================INTRO DOUBLE IMAGE STRUCTURE CSS==================== -->
      <section class=" bc-experience-section relative section-spacing overflow-hidden page-intro-section">
         <!-- Decorative sushi platter on far right -->
         <img loading="lazy" src="assets/images/business/icon-right.svg" alt=""
            class="bc-deco hidden xl:block w-40 -right-0 top-1/4" aria-hidden="true" />
         <div class="container relative z-10">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
               
                  <!-- Left: layered photo composition -->
               <div class="relative">
                  <div class="nourish-media-wrap relative">

      

                     <!-- back photo: chef portrait -->
                     <div class="nourish-photo nourish-photo-back">
                        <img loading="lazy"
                           src="assets/images/Culinaryexcellence/chef-portrait.webp"
                           alt="Nekta chef in the kitchen">
                     </div>

                     <!-- front photo: plating close-up, overlaps the back photo -->
                     <div class="nourish-photo nourish-photo-front">
                        <img loading="lazy"
                           src="assets/images/Culinaryexcellence/chef-plating.webp"
                           alt="Chef plating a dish with precision">
                     </div>

                  </div>
               </div>
               <!-- Right: copy -->
               <div class="relative space-y-6 md:space-y-8 sm:max-w-[35vw]">
                  <div class="section-title-outer mx-auto max-w-5xl">
                     <h2 class="title-section text-h2 " data-leaf-target letters-slide-down text-split>
                        From the Core to  <span class="text-letters-slide">Every Corner</span>
                     </h2>
                     
                  </div>
                  <div class="intro-outer-wrapper sm:pl-15">
                  <p>Culinary excellence is at the heart of everything Nekta delivers. From globally inspired cuisines to regional classics, our culinary team brings together innovation, technique and tradition to create food experiences that delight at every scale. As a hospitality-backed catering company drawn from TajSATS catering services and the wider Tata catering company legacy, we treat food as craft, not commodity.</p>

                  </div>

               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ==================== Why Central Kitchens Matter ==================== -->
      <section class="bc-dining-section section-pb curveshape-wrap">
            <div class="curveSvg-bg">
               <svg class="curveSvg" viewBox="0 0 1000 400" preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible">
                  <path class="curvePath" data-max-curve="140"
                        d="M0,144 L1000,144 L1000,400 L0,400 Z" fill="#e8e0c4"></path>
               </svg>
            </div>
            <!-- Tilted polaroids -->
            <div class="outer-polaroids-icons">
                  <img loading="lazy" src="assets/images/Culinaryexcellence/capsicum.webp" alt="" class="bc-deco bc-dining-deco--chili" aria-hidden="true" />

         
               
               <img loading="lazy" src="assets/images/Culinaryexcellence/burger.webp" alt="" class="bc-deco bc-dining-deco--basil" aria-hidden="true" />
            </div>


            <div class="container relative z-10">
               <!-- Section Heading -->
                     <div class="section-title-outer text-center max-w-6xl mx-auto">
                        <h2 class="title-section text text-h2" data-leaf-target letters-slide-down text-split>Why Central <span class="text-letters-slide">Kitchens Matter </span>
                        </h2>
                        
                     </div>

               <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
                     <p>
                        At Nekta, our culinary capability, together with the extended network of TajSATS facilities, forms the backbone of every experience we deliver, combining quality, consistency, and scale with absolute precision. Our kitchens enable us to prepare large volumes of food and seamlessly serve across multiple locations, whether it is a corporate cafeteria in Mumbai, a hospital facility in Bengaluru, or an event in Delhi, all adhering to the same uncompromising standards.
                     </p>
                     <p>
                        Leveraging both Nekta-operated and TajSATS kitchens, we operate on globally benchmarked aviation catering protocols. These are the same rigorous systems and disciplines that power high-volume airline catering, ensuring precision, efficiency, and reliability. Every stage, from procurement and production to
                        distribution and logistics, is integrated within this ecosystem.
                     </p>
                     <p>
                        Our culinary operations are built on a strong foundation of hygiene, safety, and compliance, aligned with both Indian and international standards, including those followed by leading global airlines. Stringent quality controls, secure handling processes, and robust governance ensure the highest levels of food safety and operational integrity.
                     </p>
                        <p>
                        Designed for scale and versatility, our kitchens feature dedicated zones for bakery and confectionery, hot food, and cold preparations. With multi-linear layouts that enable a seamless production flow, these facilities support a wide spectrum of needs, from airline catering and HORECA to corporate dining, while driving continuous culinary innovation through chef-curated menus and seasonal cafeteria menus
                     </p>
                        <p>
                        At Nekta, powered by the strength of the TajSATS network, culinary excellence is more than a capability, it is the epicentre that drives every meal, every service, and every experience we deliver.
                     </p>
               </div>
            </div>
      </section>


